\begin{cases}
3a+ b + 0c = 2,\\
a+ 2b + 2c = 4,\\
-5a+ 2b+ 2c = -5.
\end{cases}
\]

この連立方程式を解くと

\[
\begin{aligned}
3a+ b &= 2,\\
a+ 2b &= 4.
\end{aligned}
