   \[
   |\vec{AB}|=\sqrt{2^2+(-5)^2+(-1)^2}=\sqrt{4+25+1}= \sqrt{30}
   \]
   \[
   |\vec{AC}|=\sqrt{(-3)^2+3^2+(-3)^2}=\sqrt{9+9+9}= \sqrt{27}=3\sqrt{3}
   \]

4. **内積と大きさの比から角度を求める**  
   \[
   \cos\angle ABC=\frac{\vec{AB}\cdot\vec{AC}}{|\vec{AB}| |\vec{AC}|}
   =\frac{-18}{\sqrt{30}\,(3\sqrt{3})}
   =\frac{-18}{3\sqrt{90}}
   =\frac{-18}{3\sqrt{90}}
   \]
   \[
   \boxed{\cos\angle ABC=\frac{-6}{\sqrt{90}}}=- \frac{6\sqrt{10}}{15}= -\frac{2\sqrt{10}}{5}
   \]

