   \cos\angle ABC=\frac{18}{\sqrt{30}\,(3\sqrt{3})}
   =\frac{18}{3\sqrt{90}}
   =\frac{6}{\sqrt{90}}
   =\frac{6\sqrt{10}}{30}
   =\frac{\sqrt{10}}{5}
   \]

5. **角度を度に変換**  
